warning: messages-linux@0.1.0: app.contract:270:52 warning [lower-colour-one-scheme] these 33 literal colours stay the same in dark mode while the platform's text and controls change, so a light card keeps its colour under the platform's white text: name a role for each or leave it unsaid. Leave the accent unsaid (the platform's; a brand is an `app.tamber`), or write it as a role or one `light-dark(light, dark)` pair on `accent-color`. A forced `color-scheme` is no repair: the app then has no dark mode (docs/contract-for-agents.md, "Colours: say a role, not a value")
